{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011Q9cVApRwmb8cqffNe8N4m","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Anchor R&D Control Surface â€” Master Plan (Planning Trio Session Summary)\n\n**North Star (locked)**\n- Transforms Anchor from a task/project tracker into a **per-project R&D control surface**, where each code project is a folder (e.g. `C:\\dev\\Agentic-Home`, `C:\\dev\\Anchor`).\n- A single-instance dashboard window drives the **researchPrime â†’ Crucible â†’ Foreman** trio as durable, server-owned Claude Code jobs on **gwl-server**.\n- Scope includes versioned effort history, taskâ†”project integration, project lifecycle states, deliverable execution, and a **data-free public distribution**.\n\n**Locked design decisions (Master Plan)**\n- **D1 â€” One uniform job primitive:** a job is `claude -p --input-format stream-json --output-format stream-json` running the relevant skill (researchPrime / crucible / foreman) in the project cwd, **owned by the Anchor server**. A \"lane\" = which skill + prompt template; there is **no per-lane orchestration code, no PTY, stdlib only**.\n- **D2 â€” In-session gate handling:** a skill's `AskUserQuestion` gate surfaces in the stream (it auto-dismisses headless, but the structured question stays visible); Anchor renders it in a prompt box and **sends the user's choice back as a plain-text turn** to continue the session.\n\n**Decision Log â€” locked user decisions (Crucible, 2026-06-07/08)**\n- **Brownfield extension** of Anchor (`C:\\dev\\Anchor`); objective = new capability (not a rewrite).\n- **Session model = streaming console, stdlib-only** â€” not a full TUI; no PTY, no dependencies.\n- **Registry = a new parallel R&D registry**, kept distinct from the life-domain projects.\n- **Artifacts live inside each project's `.anchor/`** as pointer-records; engine outputs stay in their native form.\n- **v1 scope = all three trio lanes, Claude Code CLI only** (Gemini deferred).\n- **Auth:** run the Anchor service as **`john`** to resolve the LocalSystem credential wall.\n- **Remote access:** bind the Tailscale interface + a shared-secret token on mutating `/api/*` endpoints.\n\n**Member documents in this session**\n- Master Plan (frozen design), Implementation Plan (Foreman-ready), Execution Log, Decision Log.\n\n*Note: the anchor text for D1/D2 and decisions 6â€“7 was truncated in the provided source; the above reflects only the grounded content present in the member-document excerpts.*"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4412,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":45180,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3521007b-74aa-4a3d-af63-206f3203fd8b","uuid":"33992584-5752-437d-a214-8dca4e0627ce","request_id":"req_011Cc1hYD1nvcijXmWjBg9Jg"}
